I have a tonne of new things that I wanna do. And a-ah-I always say that I want to do new things

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:07.880
But this year especially, I'm kinda committed to..

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:14.280
allowing myself to be in the right mindset. Not only to make whatever I wanna make but also

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:18.480
allowing myself not to get bogged down on the things that don't really matter

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:22.400
when it comes to making videos, because I've been doing this for about six years now

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.800
I've--y'know I've run the gambit of the emotions of like

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:32.940
'OOH THIS IS NEW AND EXCITING' to 'Oh I miss the old days!' to 'OH YOU'VE CHANGED MARKIPLIER HOW COULD YOU DO THIS TO US!'

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:35.920
