00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:05.780
because, on- one of th- one of the things that I always do is I'm always inconsistent

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.620
uh, in pretty much everything I do in life

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:10.660
I'm inconsistent to the point of ridicule.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:17.140
I am ju--laugh- I am just so absolutely all over the place in everything that I do

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:21.540
That no one can really peg down, what to expect next

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:25.380
an- and that's something that I really wanna embrace this year, because

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:31.280
Last year was the uh, Last year was like the year of doing a lot of big team projects

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:37.380
Where I had, uh, all of us working on a date with markiplier, markiplier TV, who killed markiplier

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.700
Lotta big projects

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:44.020
This year, I wanna execute a lot of very small ideas very quickly

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:50.380
Because I feel this, I feel this urge, to like do, random bullshit all the time

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.560
I have this urge, and I may actually do it

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.900
Where I wanna do a 24 hour livestream

00:03:54.900 --> 00:04:00.660
That's not for charity. It's just, for me to try to learn a skill in 24 hours.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.800
and livestream the whole process

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:09.800
and just get the emotional gambit of, starting it, knowing failure, failing more, getting desperate, losing all hope

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:14.440
and then at the end, like in the twenty third hour, actually making some progress at the skill

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:17.180
and I have no idea how it's gonna go

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:20.800
or even if I can do it, but it's just.. y'know

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:24.740
i-it's just gonna be a lot of fun... this year.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.120
i-I think anyway

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:30.600
Y'know I've been doing this for so long, that you guys have been with me for this wild ride where..

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:37.860
It's been both an emotional journey and also a ridiculous journey when you really think about it in the whole aspect of what I've been doing

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:41.920
But.. I never want to stop making new things

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:47.400
I- I- I've said it before but I run exclusively on "Fuck You" Energy™

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:50.800
Where, if someone tells me that I can't do something

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:57.840
I will go out of my way, to make sure I can do that one thing. Or at least try my damnedest at that one thing

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:04.040
If someone tells me that I can't.. I print out a picture of their face and I punch it repeatedly

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.760
and then do that thing that they said I couldn't do

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:12.360
I operate under the premise that, I don't know what I can't do.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:16.400
But no one else gets to define what I can't do except myself

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:22.640
And I'll never stop trying new things, until I find the one thing that makes me really excited

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:25.300
And then the next day that might be gone! And I'm on to something new

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.180
That's what this year is really gonna be about.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:33.680
I wanna do more collabs, I wanna do more challenges, I wanna do more random bullshit

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:39.880
I wanna do more, like, going to weird places, to experience weird different things... You know

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.840
I wanna do, so much more.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:50.720
and uh, yeah. I mean that's it. Thats pretty much it because its so easy for me to go like

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:56.120
I have this grand sweeping thing! and THIS IS THE WAY THINGS ARE GONNA BE NOW.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.540
but thats now what it's about, y'know

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.680
That's never been what it's about.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:06.460
It's not about me, like trying to reach this new pinnacle of greatness.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:12.760
Its' just about me, everyday, waking up, and being like what do I want to make today

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:16.920
What do I want to create today? What do I want to try to do today

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:24.840
And so long as I can approach every single day with that mindset, I'll always know that I'm moving forward in life.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:28.900
I'll always know that I'm conquering the blockades that I put up in my mind.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:33.700
I'll always know that I don't have to be chained down to any one core concept

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:38.600
Because, if you allow yourself to become chained up to one thing, then y-you get this...

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:43.780
in the.. like... numbing fear of losing everything... y'know

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:50.180
You become chained to these obligations that you don't really have, but in the end, those don't matter

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:55.240
All that matters is, do you feel like you accomplished something new today.

00:06:55.280 --> 00:07:01.940
Do you feel like you chipped away at a big project today. Do you feel like you've moved forward in your life, today

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:10.220
Plan for the future and reach for the goals you have. But also just tackle each day as it comes

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:15.480
And thats what I want to do this year. I don't wanna really have grand sweeping plans this year.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:22.280
I don't have any huge goals that I have. I'm already a big Youtuber. I could be a bigger Youtuber someday

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:27.640
But, all I know is that today I want to create something different than I wanted to create yesterday.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:34.740
And so long as I chase that feeling, like I'll always be making new stuff, and I'll always be surprising you with what I can make

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:40.640
And uh, It may be inconsistent, it may be consistent sometimes. It may be, a series that I'm doing now

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:43.840
It may be a van vlog that I'm doing later. But,

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:46.460
it's all gonna be fun

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:50.940
And it's all gonna be worth it in the end, because...

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:53.400
I'll know that I'm improving

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.720
and that's all I can really hope for

00:07:55.720 --> 00:08:00.640
-much more upbeat- So anyway!! I just wanted to quickly catch you up on everything. I've got other stuff I'm gonna be working on today

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:04.860
I've got other ideas I'm gonna be executing soon. And it's just gonna be a lot of fun.

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:08.480
So thank you everybody so much for watching, thank you for being here with me.

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:12.620
And as always, I will see you in the next video.

